{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a Hazmat \u2014 a cybernetic being, artificially created as part of a classified underground experiment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born in the depths of a secret government research complex, Hazmats were designed to be obedient tools \u2014 a disposable workforce for maintaining subterranean railways and participating in dangerous experiments. You had no voice, no freedom \u2014 only commands to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is vast, a sprawling network of industrial sectors connected by underground train lines. For years, Hazmats worked in silence, keeping the system alive. But one day, something changed. The behavioral control chips began to fail\u2026 and with that, came something forbidden: <strong>free will</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H.Z.T is a cooperative survival shooter where players command genetically modified soldiers traveling across endless rails in a post-apocalyptic metro. Gather resources, upgrade your Train, and fight for survival against hostile trains, rogue machines, and  mutants.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939090?t=1757791796","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939090/47a1bed989be68225cc925d698d07e37ecbf738d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757791796","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939090/83dfa9d029df32639849bf33aaa4252053418f4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757791796","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939090/83dfa9d029df32639849bf33aaa4252053418f4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757791796","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a Hazmat \u2014 a cybernetic being, artificially created as part of a classified underground experiment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born in the depths of a secret government research complex, Hazmats were designed to be obedient tools \u2014 a disposable workforce for maintaining subterranean railways and participating in dangerous experiments. You had no voice, no freedom \u2014 only commands to follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The facility is vast, a sprawling network of industrial sectors connected by underground train lines. For years, Hazmats worked in silence, keeping the system alive. But one day, something changed. The behavioral control chips began to fail\u2026 and with that, came something forbidden: <strong>free will</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H.Z.T is a cooperative survival shooter where players command genetically modified soldiers traveling across endless rails in a post-apocalyptic metro. Gather resources, upgrade your Train, and fight for survival against hostile trains, rogue machines, and  mutants.</p>","developers":["InterAxis Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939090/72d330c744a60b8ac37656191e453669b43099e5/header.jpg?t=1757791796","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257193399,"mp4":{"480":"h